---
description: Keep secrets on the server; never put API keys in the Expo app.
globs: mobile/**,server/**
alwaysApply: true
---

# Secrets stay on the server

- Put keys in `.env` (git-ignored). Never hardcode ElevenLabs, Grok, Mapbox, Nessie, or Supabase keys.
- The phone app talks to `/api` through `mobile/src/api.js`. Base URL is `EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL` only. Never put ElevenLabs or Grok keys in the app.
- `api.js` must return `null` on network failure so screens can fall back to sample data.
- Eggs are earned by walking. Never spend Nessie savings on eggs.
